---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Header		: INPUT_REF
--
-- MIB ref		: swCardEventLogSlotXX       .9.73.78.80.85.84.95.82.69.70
-- absolute OID	: 1.3.6.1.4.1.7995.2.6.1.1.XX.9.73.78.80.85.84.95.82.69.70
-- Vary			: YES
--
-- Value(s)		: OK
--				: LOST
--				: ERR
-- Comments		: This log field shows the status of the reference input.
--				: LOST indicates no reference input detected.
